        "leaf": "260921-ICR-L46"
      },
      "rationale": "When the review was seeded from an invariant, re-selects each discovered family by its family identity rather than by the invariant's memberships. It then computes each side's population and heads separately and reads both rosters through read_family_roster for the selected revisions. A family the selected invariant no longer belongs to keeps its counterpart, and its head is not pinned to the predecessor that still cites the member.",
